    "created_at": "2023-09-18T06:39:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-18T06:39:14Z",
    "body": "The pseudo-class matches all elements that do not match `:read-write`: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#selector-read-only. And so yes, that includes elements to which the `readonly` attribute does not apply. That seems orthogonal to this issue.",
